        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana S44R5BB, 4\" x 4\" x 5/8\" Radius With 2 Ball Bearings Steel Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a pair of hinges (2) with matching finish steel flathead, Phillips Drive #9 x 1\" wood screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFitted with a high grade, removable, steel pin. Utilizes zig-zag screw hole pattern for use with wood doors. This hinge is normally  used on light - medium weight entry doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-S44R5BB-specifications.gif?v=1704354546\" width=\"600\" height=\"255\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana S44BB Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 4 Inch Entry Door Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Durable Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: 5/8\" Radius</li>\r\n<li>Barrel Diameter: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Dual Ball-Bearings: 2BB</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.085\" (Residential)</li>\r\n<li>Standard Zig-Zag Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #9 x 1\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-S44BB-specifications.pdf?v=1704262256\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana S44R5BB Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "4 x 4 x 5/8 Radius With Ball Bearings Steel Hinge",
                "description": "Deltana S44R5BB 4 Inch with 5/8 Radius corners steel hinges, with 2 ball bearings. These Deltana hinges are available in 8 different finish colors. This hinge is normally  used on light - medium weight entry doors.",
